      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- Magyx LP22 MEN — light hero + four benefit blocks. Custom Liquid paste block.\n     Self-contained: egna klasser (ts-m22-*), egen CSS, ingen Liquid-tagg.\n     Two images: wide for desktop, separate portrait crop for mobile. -->\n\n<div class=\"ts-m22\">\n  <section class=\"ts-m22-hero\">\n    <div class=\"ts-m22-inner\">\n      <p class=\"ts-m22-eyebrow\"><span>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> Verified by over 10,000 fragrance lovers</p>\n      <h1>Make the right impression.</h1>\n      <p class=\"ts-m22-sub\">Find the scent that impresses before you've said a word.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ts-m22-feats\">\n    <div class=\"ts-m22-inner ts-m22-grid\">\n      <div class=\"ts-m22-feat\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v12H4z\"/><path d=\"M4 7l2-3h12l2 3\"/><path d=\"M10 11h4\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Made in Europe</h3>\n        <p>Free from harmful or harsh chemicals.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-m22-feat\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3s6 6.5 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 9.5 12 3 12 3z\"/></svg>\n        <h3>21% fragrance concentration</h3>\n        <p>It's the concentration that gives a perfume its DNA.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-m22-feat\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.2 7.8-8 9-4.8-1.2-8-4.5-8-9V6l8-3z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2.2 2.2L15.5 10\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Money back for 60 days</h3>\n        <p>Try the perfume at home. If it doesn't suit you, send it back.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-m22-feat\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5.2l3.2 2\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Long-lasting scent</h3>\n        <p>Made to stay noticeable for up to 12 hours.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .ts-m22{\n    --ts-hero-img:url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/magyx-lp22-hero-male-v9.jpg?v=1787283606');\n    --ts-ink:#14181c;\n    --ts-muted:#5d666e;\n    --ts-accent:#8f6329;\n    width:100vw;\n    margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);\n    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n  }\n  .ts-m22 *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{overflow-x:hidden}\n  .ts-m22-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}\n\n  /* ---------- hero ---------- */\n  .ts-m22-hero{\n    position:relative;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    height:clamp(430px,33.33vw,600px);\n    background-color:#eef1f3;\n    background-image:var(--ts-hero-img);\n    background-size:cover;\n    background-position:50% 3%;\n    background-repeat:no-repeat;\n  }\n  .ts-m22-hero::before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    inset:0;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(248,248,247,.97) 0%,rgba(248,248,247,.93) 30%,rgba(248,248,247,.72) 46%,rgba(248,248,247,0) 68%);\n  }\n  .ts-m22-hero .ts-m22-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%}\n  .ts-m22-eyebrow{\n    margin:0 0 10px;\n    font-size:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:.16em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--ts-accent);\n  }\n  .ts-m22-eyebrow span{letter-spacing:.06em;margin-right:6px}\n  .ts-m22-hero h1{\n    margin:0 0 12px;\n    font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;\n    font-weight:400;\n    font-size:clamp(28px,2.8vw,44px);\n    line-height:1.1;\n    letter-spacing:-.015em;\n    max-width:none;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n    color:var(--ts-ink);\n  }\n  .ts-m22-sub{\n    margin:0;\n    max-width:400px;\n    font-size:clamp(15px,1.05vw,17px);\n    line-height:1.5;\n    color:var(--ts-ink);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- four feature blocks ---------- */\n  .ts-m22-feats{background:#fff;padding:44px 0 40px}\n  .ts-m22-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:34px;text-align:center}\n  .ts-m22-feat svg{\n    width:38px;height:38px;fill:none;stroke:var(--ts-ink);\n    stroke-width:1.75;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;margin-bottom:16px;\n  }\n  .ts-m22-feat h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ts-ink)}\n  .ts-m22-feat p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ts-muted)}\n\n  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */\n  @media(max-width:900px){.ts-m22-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:28px}}\n  @media(max-width:640px){\n    .ts-m22-hero{\n      /* separate portrait crop - all three people fit in the narrow format */\n      --ts-hero-img:url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/magyx-lp22-hero-male-v10-mobile.jpg?v=1787326720');\n      height:auto;\n      min-height:520px;\n      align-items:flex-end;\n      padding:0 0 34px;\n      background-position:50% 10%;\n    }\n    .ts-m22-hero::before{\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,\n        rgba(246,247,248,0) 38%,\n        rgba(246,247,248,.82) 58%,\n        rgba(246,247,248,.97) 74%,\n        #f6f7f8 100%);\n    }\n    .ts-m22-sub{max-width:none}\n\n    /* OPTION: eyebrow wraps to two lines on phones. Uncomment the line for a single line. */\n    /* .ts-m22-eyebrow{letter-spacing:.08em} */\n  }\n  @media(max-width:520px){.ts-m22-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>",
