    "custom_liquid_37D6Ew": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- Magyx — Social proof (herr) — Custom Liquid paste block.\n     8 reviews from male customers on Trustpilot (se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co),\n     fetched 20.08.2026. Themes: scent quality, similarity to the original, longevity.\n     Citat verbatim; endast emoji borttagna och interpunktion normaliserad.\n     Ren HTML+CSS, scoped till .ts-proof-sv. Inga Liquid-taggar. -->\n\n<style>\n  .ts-proof-sv{\n    --green:#14843d;\n    --green-dark:#0f6b31;\n    --green-soft:#eaf6ee;\n    --ink:#111315;\n    --muted:#626b74;\n    --line:#e6e8e8;\n    --star:#ffb000;\n    font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7f8f6);\n    padding:76px 0 53px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\n  .ts-proof-sv .container{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));margin-inline:auto}\n  .ts-proof-sv .proof-head{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 15px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .kicker{\n    font-size:13px;\n    letter-spacing:.13em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    font-weight:800;\n    color:var(--green);\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .section-title{\n    font-size:clamp(26px,3.3vw,43px);\n    line-height:1.02;\n    letter-spacing:-.045em;\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:22px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n    padding:8px 4px 22px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card{\n    flex:0 0 calc(33.333% - 15px);\n    min-width:330px;\n    scroll-snap-align:start;\n    background:#fff;\n    border:1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:20px;\n    padding:26px 26px 13px;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(16,34,22,.06);\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-top{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:14px;\n    margin-bottom:11px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-stars{color:var(--star);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:19px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n  .ts-proof-sv .tp-dot{color:var(--green)}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card h3{\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.22;\n    letter-spacing:-.035em;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p{\n    color:var(--muted);\n    line-height:1.62;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p.result-line{\n    margin:8px 0 12px;\n    padding:15px 16px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:var(--green-soft);\n    color:var(--green-dark);\n    font-weight:800;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person strong{display:block;font-size:14px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35;display:block}\n  @media (max-width:1024px){\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{flex-basis:48%}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:700px){\n    .ts-proof-sv{padding:30px 0 21px}\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{min-width:86%;flex-basis:86%}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"ts-proof-sv\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"proof-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Why they stayed with Magyx</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">They say it better than we ever could.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"carousel\">\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The best part is they last incredibly long &#8211; both on the skin and in your clothes.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Really good quality for the money. The perfumes smell exclusive. Perfect if you want luxurious, deep scents without paying too much. Smooth website and a good experience overall. Highly recommended!</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Stays on the skin. And in your clothes.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Hassan Alzoubi</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Lasts a really long time, up to 24h if not more.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Took a couple of days to get the items. I'd ordered 6 different perfumes. All of them smell very close to the original. Recommended for the thrifty.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">A full day on the skin.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Abdish Milli</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Lasts better than the original.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>All the scents smell exactly like the original.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Daniel</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The perfumes last long and are very identical.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Got my first order of 6 different perfumes, now I've ordered 8 more and look forward to when they arrive.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Six bottles first. Then eight more.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Samer Najmadin</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The scents are wonderful, they last all day long.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Really smooth purchase and a good website.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Fredrik Karlsson</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;At first I was skeptical &#8230;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>But when I placed my first order I discovered the perfumes are amazing and very similar to the original perfumes. The price is also really, really good. I'll definitely keep shopping from Magyx in the future.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Skeptical before. Regular customer now.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ahmad Ismail</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;It's not the brand that smells, it's what's inside.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>The scents are so close to the originals, but at a fraction of what the original costs.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Kristian Ljunggren</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The quality exceeded my expectations.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>I ordered two perfumes and I'm really impressed. The scents are very similar to the originals. The service was also fast and professional. I'm very happy with my purchase and can warmly recommend you to others.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Amran Timimi</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
